https://github.com/Jay61616/banking-modern-datastack/tree/main

Steps to execute:
1. Intialize the docker container and verify the services like postgress, minio, airflow etc
2. Connect to postgres using dbeaver
3. Run faker data generator
4. Run Kafka connect and consumer to copy cdc data from postgres to minio s3 RAW bucket
5. Create and Run AIrflow DAG to copy data from minio to snowflake(Initial+Incremental)
6. Create dbt sources, snapshots to created Materialized views, DIM and FACT tables
7. Create and Run DAG to trigger DBT pipelines. 